Package: FINNmodelNBINetherlands
Type: Package
Title: A Fitted FINN Forest Model for Dutch Forests (NBI)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Yannek", family = "Käber", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "y.kaeber@posteo.de", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7041-9849")),
      person(given = "Maximilian", family = "Pichler", role = "aut",
             email = "maximilian.pichler@biologie.uni-regensburg.de", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2252-8327")))
Description: A fitted FINN forest model calibrated to the tree-by-tree remeasurement
    of the permanent plots of the Dutch National Forest Inventory (Nederlandse
    Bosinventarisatie: MFV 2001-2005, NBI-6 2012-2013, NBI-7 2017-2021), packaged
    as a versioned simulation tool. Loads the released parameters, rebuilds the
    model with the installed FINN and simulates forest dynamics for new sites.
